{"title": "True Love's Embrace", "pageid": 9199, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/True_Love's_Embrace", "categories": ["Rings", "Rare items", "Low HP set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_B_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Ring_B_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_B_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/e/e1/Ring_B_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"True Love's Embrace image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Ring_B_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_B_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Ring_B_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">True Love's Embrace</span></a> is one of a matching pair of <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a> that lets the wearer cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/38px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/50px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warding Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\">Warding Bond</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The scholar of love, Joel Firris Baldidims, writes that the next time he reads about a woman compared to a flower (or any feature of geography for that matter) he's going to start knocking on poets' doors with a sledgehammer.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 70 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  70  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_TWN_BondedByLove_HusbandsRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_TWN_BondedByLove_HusbandsRing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_TWN_BondedByLove_HusbandsRing\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7becedf0-a90a-40d3-a726-e4e671f3d73f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7becedf0-a90a-40d3-a726-e4e671f3d73f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7becedf0-a90a-40d3-a726-e4e671f3d73f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TWN_BondedByLove_HusbandsRing</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_BondedByLove_HusbandsRing+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TWN_BondedByLove_HusbandsRing+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Intimate_Embrace\" title=\"Intimate Embrace\">Intimate Embrace</a></dt><dd>One of a magical pair of rings, this allows the wearer to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/38px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/50px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warding Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\">Warding Bond</a> once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a> on a creature wearing the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Love%27s_Caress\" title=\"True Love's Caress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Love%27s_Caress\" title=\"True Love's Caress\">matching ring</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-212&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;0</span>: On a skeleton laying on a mattress on the ground</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The matching ring is <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Love%27s_Caress\" title=\"True Love's Caress\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Ring_B_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Love%27s_Caress\" title=\"True Love's Caress\">True Love's Caress</a>, found on a skeleton leaning up against a large tree in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-147&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;43</span>.</li>\n<li>This ring is found on the same corpse as <a href=\"/wiki/Bonded_By_Love_-_Husband%27s_Diary\" title=\"Bonded By Love - Husband's Diary\">Bonded By Love - Husband's Diary</a>, which describes a newlywed man who is taken to the House of Healing after suffering from a myriad of mysterious injuries. The husband describes how, prior to receiving these injuries, his wife went to battle against an entire troop of Harpers and defeated them without getting a single scratch.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonded_By_Love_-_Husband%27s_Diary\" title=\"Bonded By Love - Husband's Diary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Book_Generic_I_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bonded_By_Love_-_Husband%27s_Diary\" title=\"Bonded By Love - Husband's Diary\">Bonded By Love - Husband's Diary</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bonded_By_Love_-_Wife%27s_Diary\" title=\"Bonded By Love - Wife's Diary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bonded_By_Love_-_Wife%27s_Diary\" title=\"Bonded By Love - Wife's Diary\">Bonded By Love - Wife's Diary</a></span></li></ul></li>\n<li>After casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/38px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/50px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warding Bond\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp/25px-Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Warding_Bond_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warding_Bond\" title=\"Warding Bond\">Warding Bond</a>, the condition persists even if both party members unequip the rings. It lasts until death or a Long Rest.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195741\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3123/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 44828/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10334/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1393463/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.630      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   75.630      1 -total\n 22.62%   17.110      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 22.15%   16.753      1 Template:PageSeo\n 21.89%   16.554     36 Template:Trim\n 20.84%   15.764      6 Template:Icon_text\n 17.45%   13.196      3 Template:Item_icon\n 16.09%   12.167      3 Template:Icon_link\n 15.31%   11.576     13 Template:Ifempty\n 15.26%   11.540      3 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9199-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195741 and revision id 373804. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}